WEBVTT

01:51.000 --> 01:52.360
Chancellor Gao,

01:53.200 --> 01:55.240
I am deeply grateful for your help

01:56.200 --> 01:57.440
these past days.

01:59.560 --> 02:01.200
No need to thank me.

02:02.040 --> 02:03.000
If anything,

02:05.000 --> 02:06.480
I am the one who owes you.

02:07.800 --> 02:11.400
I was too wary of you back then.

02:12.760 --> 02:15.760
You are His Majesty's strategist.

02:16.680 --> 02:19.760
You shoulder the fate of the realm.

02:20.360 --> 02:21.520
It was right for you

02:22.840 --> 02:24.160
to be cautious of me.

02:25.600 --> 02:26.720
Hearing you say so

02:28.240 --> 02:29.200
and thinking

02:30.440 --> 02:33.360
of the steamed buns
I've been sending you this past month,

02:35.200 --> 02:37.240
I can finally feel at ease.

02:41.200 --> 02:42.600
It's been over a month.

02:43.920 --> 02:46.400
Is your hand healed?

02:46.480 --> 02:47.720
Yes.

02:49.400 --> 02:50.440
And your legs?

02:56.400 --> 02:57.560
Probably

02:58.960 --> 03:00.480
about the same as yours.

03:17.400 --> 03:18.600
It is already the Zi hour.

03:19.920 --> 03:21.680
Time is running short.

03:22.440 --> 03:23.480
But at least

03:24.880 --> 03:26.920
it is a gentle night.

03:46.400 --> 03:48.040
What is this?

03:50.560 --> 03:51.960
It reads like a farewell letter.

03:52.800 --> 03:54.040
And he tells us not to worry?

03:58.200 --> 03:59.320
Stop worrying.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.680
Huai'an will be fine.

04:09.400 --> 04:10.240
Sir.

04:10.320 --> 04:10.880
CANGYUE TOWER

04:15.920 --> 04:16.760
Mr. Wuyin.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.760
Please rest here.

04:20.279 --> 04:23.480
At dawn, General Fengshan will await you
at Taiqing Hall.

04:59.960 --> 05:00.840
Sir,

05:01.560 --> 05:03.040
don't be uneasy about tonight.

05:03.680 --> 05:04.640
I will stand guard.

05:07.640 --> 05:08.760
I'm not uneasy.

05:09.840 --> 05:10.920
I'm simply wondering

05:11.520 --> 05:13.320
why a prosperous city like Chang'an

05:13.400 --> 05:15.120
produces such folk.

05:17.640 --> 05:19.640
A slave girl who could play the guqin
turned out

05:19.720 --> 05:20.720
to be an assassin.

05:21.440 --> 05:24.000
A peddler who appeared
to be from Tiemo turned out

05:24.080 --> 05:25.000
to be the mastermind.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.160
And then there's Yan Fengshan.

05:27.240 --> 05:30.960
He wants to borrow my troops
to attack his own city.

05:33.640 --> 05:35.680
Dealing with these people

05:35.760 --> 05:37.040
is exhausting.

05:40.160 --> 05:41.600
That's enough for today.

05:41.680 --> 05:42.880
You should rest early as well.

05:43.800 --> 05:44.640
Yes, sir.

06:03.000 --> 06:04.320
As long as you keep quiet,

06:05.080 --> 06:06.120
you will be fine.

06:06.200 --> 06:08.120
We go way back.

06:08.720 --> 06:11.560
I have something to discuss with you.

06:14.000 --> 06:15.640
Don't breathe into my palm.

06:15.720 --> 06:17.880
Two men alone in the dark

06:17.960 --> 06:19.280
at this hour

06:20.080 --> 06:21.280
is strange enough as it is.

06:22.280 --> 06:23.120
Stop laughing.

06:23.200 --> 06:25.440
I'm going to move my hand away.

06:25.520 --> 06:26.960
As long as you don't shout,

06:27.720 --> 06:28.840
my axe

06:30.160 --> 06:31.840
will stay where it is.

06:39.680 --> 06:40.960
Come on.

06:41.040 --> 06:42.880
At least let me light a candle

06:43.480 --> 06:45.240
so I can see
which old acquaintance you are.

06:46.760 --> 06:49.800
We're two grown men alone in the dark.

06:49.880 --> 06:50.720
It's strange enough.

06:50.800 --> 06:52.280
Don't mimic me.

06:54.160 --> 06:55.080
Fine.

07:14.640 --> 07:17.000
-I don't recognize you.
-Hold on.

07:17.080 --> 07:20.080
I'm not some maiden. Why the rush?

07:20.840 --> 07:24.080
Your tone sounds familiar.

07:25.400 --> 07:27.360
Why can't I place it?

07:28.000 --> 07:28.840
Be patient.

07:31.080 --> 07:32.520
You'll know soon enough.

07:54.120 --> 07:56.080
This grows stranger by the moment.

08:16.080 --> 08:17.760
I still don't recognize you.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.160
Wuyin Chong,

08:54.240 --> 08:56.440
you came to Chang'an as a secret envoy

08:57.680 --> 08:59.680
and the Tiemo prince,

09:00.800 --> 09:03.640
so I shall meet you
as the Emperor of Chang'an.

09:05.440 --> 09:06.680
I just want you to know

09:07.840 --> 09:08.800
that I am still alive.

09:09.920 --> 09:11.760
The Xiao imperial line
still has a survivor.

09:12.880 --> 09:15.280
Whatever you discussed
with that traitor Yan Fengshan

09:16.320 --> 09:17.320
won't count.

09:21.800 --> 09:23.680
We do go way back.

09:25.000 --> 09:27.720
The whole world believes you died
in the palace fire.

09:27.800 --> 09:29.040
Who would have thought?

09:34.160 --> 09:35.360
The look in your eyes,

09:36.000 --> 09:37.160
the way you speak,

09:37.840 --> 09:40.960
and even the way you do things
have all changed.

09:43.160 --> 09:46.160
But you are the Emperor of Chang'an.

09:46.240 --> 09:48.200
Why hide your own face?

09:48.280 --> 09:49.360
Why do you think?

09:50.080 --> 09:52.280
To protect myself, of course,

09:52.360 --> 09:53.840
while I deal with Yan Fengshan.

09:55.000 --> 09:56.440
Just as you said,

09:57.320 --> 10:00.400
you are now nothing more
than a fugitive trying to stay alive.

10:01.200 --> 10:03.840
What right have you to supplant
Yan Fengshan and make a pact with me?

10:08.960 --> 10:12.520
You call yourself an emperor,
but do you have any force to command?

10:25.280 --> 10:28.200
Xie Huai'an truly is
the smartest man in the world.

10:29.360 --> 10:31.920
He even guessed every sentence

10:32.000 --> 10:33.240
and every word

10:34.320 --> 10:35.240
you were going to say.

10:38.960 --> 10:39.880
It's the Chou hour.

10:41.240 --> 10:42.200
Come with me.

10:44.040 --> 10:45.320
I'll show you

10:47.000 --> 10:48.000
the force I command.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.760
Please enjoy, sirs.

11:38.960 --> 11:40.320
Why are you staring at me?

11:41.640 --> 11:43.520
Your force isn't here yet anyway.

11:45.280 --> 11:46.160
Who says?

13:19.280 --> 13:20.120
Listen.

13:30.440 --> 13:32.160
That is just one of my guards.

13:32.720 --> 13:34.200
He is there

13:35.920 --> 13:38.480
to keep you from trying anything.

13:50.920 --> 13:52.040
Listen more closely.

14:04.400 --> 14:06.560
Rumor holds that Chang'an
fell into chaos last month.

14:07.960 --> 14:10.440
Xiao Wuyang and Gu Yu vanished,

14:10.520 --> 14:11.600
their fate unknown.

14:13.160 --> 14:16.240
The great strategist Gao Yan
had his legs broken.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.800
He now moves on a cart

14:18.760 --> 14:21.640
and is kept in the palace
as a lantern keeper,

14:21.720 --> 14:24.400
only allowed out at the Chou hour
to deliver memorials to Yan Fengshan.

14:27.480 --> 14:29.720
That Xie Huai'an you mentioned

14:29.800 --> 14:31.360
managed to get Gao Yan out.

14:31.440 --> 14:33.320
A remarkable feat.

15:07.680 --> 15:09.320
I am that force.

15:49.920 --> 15:52.480
The Xiao imperial line
still has a survivor,

15:52.560 --> 15:55.000
and Gu Yu of the Baiwenhu Army
still lives.

15:55.960 --> 15:57.720
Chang'an

15:57.800 --> 16:00.160
is not yet ruled by Yan Fengshan.

16:01.360 --> 16:04.720
Whatever pact you plan to make
with him tomorrow

16:04.800 --> 16:07.200
will not stand.

16:08.320 --> 16:10.000
Chang'an

16:10.080 --> 16:12.040
will change hands again,

16:12.840 --> 16:14.760
and the fight will be
against Yan Fengshan.

16:16.120 --> 16:18.200
If you make a pact with him,

16:19.120 --> 16:21.360
the north will also change hands,

16:22.640 --> 16:23.640
and the fight will be against you.

16:24.480 --> 16:25.760
General Gu,

16:25.840 --> 16:28.400
my people and yours have fought for years.

16:29.000 --> 16:30.440
We have never feared you.

16:33.000 --> 16:34.000
His Majesty,

16:34.680 --> 16:35.520
I,

16:36.560 --> 16:38.400
and the entire city of Chang'an

16:39.000 --> 16:41.800
have been pressed to this state
by Yan Fengshan,

16:42.760 --> 16:44.360
but we have not been defeated.

16:45.160 --> 16:46.800
You are not without fear.

16:50.880 --> 16:52.600
You fear the one

16:54.280 --> 16:56.480
who has been planning all of this for us.

17:02.400 --> 17:05.280
Xie Huai'an is the son of Liu Ziwen.

17:07.000 --> 17:09.160
He's the one who gave you a new face

17:09.760 --> 17:11.480
and the one who helped you survive.

17:13.079 --> 17:14.200
Am I right?

17:14.880 --> 17:15.800
Yes.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.560
The last two generations of the Liu family

17:22.640 --> 17:24.359
produced extraordinary men in succession.

17:25.480 --> 17:28.119
They have used up
decades of Chang'an's fortune.

17:35.320 --> 17:36.360
I understand now.

17:43.040 --> 17:45.600
This night shall be
the most unforgettable of my life.

17:50.880 --> 17:52.640
Tonight makes me

17:52.720 --> 17:54.480
fall in love with Chang'an anew.

18:04.520 --> 18:06.600
Your Majesty, it has been a long time.

18:09.400 --> 18:11.440
We actually met before.

18:12.760 --> 18:14.720
You simply didn't know it was me.

18:15.360 --> 18:16.880
Keeping you hidden at his side

18:18.680 --> 18:20.280
was indeed the best strategy.

18:24.160 --> 18:26.680
But according to the plan,

18:27.800 --> 18:30.080
he should already be
in Yan Fengshan's hands now.

18:30.880 --> 18:32.880
On the road toward killing Yan Fengshan,

18:35.040 --> 18:37.080
all of us must pay a price.

18:44.640 --> 18:46.440
May I have that flask of wine?

18:47.960 --> 18:49.400
Is it for Chancellor Gao?

23:00.960 --> 23:02.520
This painting of you

23:03.400 --> 23:04.760
bears my wish for you.

23:05.360 --> 23:06.800
I hope you can tend flowers,

23:07.920 --> 23:08.800
keep a cat,

23:10.040 --> 23:11.560
nap on the porch,

23:12.400 --> 23:13.840
and live in peace,

23:14.720 --> 23:16.000
even for just one day.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.240
You're awake.

24:13.080 --> 24:15.560
The General has gone to the palace
to meet Wuyin Chong.

24:16.400 --> 24:19.120
He instructed me to treat you as a guest.

24:19.200 --> 24:20.280
I brought you a basin of water

24:21.080 --> 24:22.000
to wipe the blood off.

25:09.520 --> 25:11.280
You knew she lay buried here?

25:27.680 --> 25:28.520
Yes.

25:35.160 --> 25:38.440
And you still chose
to stay in this residence?

25:41.800 --> 25:42.640
Yes.

25:48.320 --> 25:49.400
Were you involved

25:51.360 --> 25:52.800
in her death as well?

25:58.280 --> 26:00.040
-Take care.
-Goodbye.

26:05.560 --> 26:06.520
Yes.

26:10.320 --> 26:12.120
Then you too, must die.

26:37.600 --> 26:39.960
FOR LIU ZIWEN ONLY

26:40.040 --> 26:43.600
This is my plan.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.360
It…

26:52.520 --> 26:54.040
it is far too risky.

26:55.920 --> 26:56.880
Back then,

26:58.200 --> 27:00.520
you did not help my father
get rid of Yan Fengshan.

27:01.840 --> 27:03.080
I will not question

27:04.520 --> 27:05.880
your reasons.

27:10.600 --> 27:11.520
It is

27:12.480 --> 27:13.880
only natural for people

27:15.520 --> 27:16.720
to put themselves first.

27:17.920 --> 27:19.200
I am using your guilt

27:20.480 --> 27:22.040
toward the Liu family

27:23.080 --> 27:24.520
to force your hand.

27:27.480 --> 27:29.960
I am the one going too far.

27:37.360 --> 27:38.400
Mr. Yang.

27:48.160 --> 27:49.720
We act at the Chou hour.

27:49.800 --> 27:50.960
By the Yin hour,

27:51.520 --> 27:53.640
Yan Fengshan will have received the news

27:54.320 --> 27:56.680
and realized you were involved.

27:57.440 --> 27:59.080
You must depart at once.

28:00.200 --> 28:02.320
Zhu Zhilong will be waiting for you

28:02.400 --> 28:04.240
at the Yuelao Temple
50 li west of the city.

28:05.000 --> 28:05.880
After this,

28:06.840 --> 28:10.040
your business in Chang'an and elsewhere

28:10.720 --> 28:12.240
will certainly be affected.

28:14.120 --> 28:15.840
If I prevail in the following days,

28:16.600 --> 28:17.960
I shall repay

28:18.800 --> 28:20.600
every loss you suffer.

28:26.080 --> 28:27.320
Boss.

28:31.800 --> 28:33.640
Boss, what's going on?

28:34.960 --> 28:36.160
Is the court cleaning house?

28:37.240 --> 28:39.480
The books we cannot let anyone see
are over there.

28:39.560 --> 28:40.680
I'll get them.

28:58.320 --> 28:59.160
Boss,

29:00.120 --> 29:01.240
what is wrong with you?

30:31.960 --> 30:32.800
General Fengshan,

30:33.400 --> 30:34.960
my master says

30:35.040 --> 30:36.800
the agreement you and he
were about to reach

30:36.880 --> 30:39.400
does not align with Tiemo's interests,
so it will be set aside for now.

30:40.520 --> 30:44.520
But the army we sent
to hold back the Baiwenhu Army

30:44.600 --> 30:46.560
will not retreat.

30:46.640 --> 30:48.440
Everything will remain as it is.

30:48.520 --> 30:50.480
General, you may rest assured.

30:53.520 --> 30:54.360
I see.

30:56.600 --> 30:59.800
The struggle for Chang'an is not yet over.

30:59.880 --> 31:01.560
My master hopes you will soon become

31:02.280 --> 31:04.600
the one who rules Chang'an.

31:10.760 --> 31:11.960
Old friend,

31:12.520 --> 31:14.680
do not worry about the outcome anymore.

31:15.440 --> 31:16.520
Rest in peace.

31:48.160 --> 31:49.480
General Fengshan.

31:52.520 --> 31:54.760
This life-and-death plan of Gao Yan's

31:54.840 --> 31:57.680
was executed flawlessly
with the people outside.

31:58.640 --> 32:00.520
You were the one handling

32:02.680 --> 32:04.440
all the message delivery, weren't you?

32:13.440 --> 32:16.480
So Gu Yu had been hiding here

32:17.160 --> 32:18.800
for over a month?

32:21.800 --> 32:24.000
No wonder even after
searching all of Chang'an,

32:24.080 --> 32:26.080
we never found a trace.

32:28.880 --> 32:32.680
Gao Yan and Gu Yu actually joined hands.

32:37.520 --> 32:39.240
I accept my loss

32:40.040 --> 32:41.080
in this round.

32:47.920 --> 32:49.120
Cease this pretense.

32:50.160 --> 32:52.720
A man who has served three emperors

32:52.800 --> 32:54.560
has eyes sharper than a blade.

32:55.640 --> 32:58.440
You know perfectly well
if I intend to kill you.

33:06.960 --> 33:08.800
Your eyes are sharp too, General.

33:09.960 --> 33:12.000
All I did was sigh once
while wiping the floor,

33:12.680 --> 33:14.120
and you noticed immediately.

33:16.240 --> 33:17.960
When you were setting this up,

33:18.640 --> 33:21.080
White Hair had already fallen
into my hands.

33:21.800 --> 33:22.800
Otherwise,

33:24.160 --> 33:25.720
I truly would have killed you.

33:28.760 --> 33:31.040
I helped you get into the palace

33:31.120 --> 33:33.160
so you could live out your years in peace.

33:35.320 --> 33:38.520
This is a good place to grow old quietly.

33:40.520 --> 33:41.760
Stay here and behave yourself.

33:59.200 --> 34:01.600
-Sir.
-Come in.

34:05.640 --> 34:07.840
I have conveyed your message
to Yan Fengshan.

34:07.920 --> 34:11.159
But Yan Fengshan has always
been scheming and calculating.

34:11.960 --> 34:13.120
Given the situation,

34:13.199 --> 34:15.159
we should return to Tiemo
as soon as possible.

34:16.000 --> 34:17.120
I understand what you mean,

34:17.800 --> 34:20.280
but Yan Fengshan would not
dare move against us.

34:23.000 --> 34:24.360
Even so, it is time to head back.

34:39.800 --> 34:43.320
FUZE INN

36:01.760 --> 36:04.960
This is a rare treat in Chang'an.

36:09.040 --> 36:10.160
Want one?

36:11.520 --> 36:12.360
Sure.

36:16.880 --> 36:18.840
This end

36:18.920 --> 36:20.560
is most bitter.

36:20.640 --> 36:21.960
You shouldn't

36:22.640 --> 36:24.040
chew too much of it,

36:24.120 --> 36:25.640
or all you'll taste

36:25.720 --> 36:27.280
is bitterness.

36:28.400 --> 36:29.920
Of course I know that.

36:32.120 --> 36:35.200
Twenty-five years ago,
I infiltrated Tiemo as a scout.

36:35.280 --> 36:37.520
I barely had any money.

36:37.600 --> 36:39.120
It was freezing there,

36:39.200 --> 36:42.000
and chewing this was how I kept warm
and stayed awake.

36:42.760 --> 36:45.160
It used to be cheaper than horse fodder.

36:46.840 --> 36:48.200
But now the price has gone up.

36:49.040 --> 36:50.120
A small bundle

36:51.040 --> 36:52.120
costs two liang.

36:53.280 --> 36:55.320
At your request,
the Tiemo forces have held

36:55.400 --> 36:56.840
the Baiwenhu Army in a standoff.

36:57.840 --> 37:00.000
They stand so close
their horses are near nose to nose.

37:00.520 --> 37:01.920
With things so tense,

37:03.240 --> 37:05.240
few merchants dare travel back and forth.

37:05.320 --> 37:06.640
The supply is unstable,

37:07.480 --> 37:08.560
and naturally,

37:08.640 --> 37:10.520
the price rises.

37:11.120 --> 37:13.560
Last night, you staged quite a show.

37:13.640 --> 37:16.000
You did far more
than persuade Wuyin Chong.

37:16.760 --> 37:18.800
The sharp merchants will soon realize

37:19.640 --> 37:21.200
the Tiemo forces will not march south.

37:22.280 --> 37:23.440
When that happens,

37:23.520 --> 37:25.520
the price will naturally fall again.

37:28.080 --> 37:30.920
The whole game has been thrown into chaos,

37:32.080 --> 37:33.800
yet you seem remarkably calm.

37:38.760 --> 37:41.080
Victory and defeat
are commonplace in warfare.

37:41.760 --> 37:43.440
One who cares too much
about gains and losses

37:45.000 --> 37:46.720
cannot be a true commander.

37:48.400 --> 37:50.880
Speaking of which,
you cling to gains and losses quite a bit.

37:53.120 --> 37:54.720
You buried Wei Qianting,

37:55.400 --> 37:57.200
sent Pu Nichuan to his death,

37:58.120 --> 38:00.840
and killed Liu Ziyan with your own hands.

38:01.560 --> 38:03.440
Qingyi has vanished,

38:04.400 --> 38:06.600
and even Wang Pu
was outwitted and killed by you.

38:08.280 --> 38:10.360
All I have left beside me is Zhiying.

38:11.320 --> 38:12.440
Do you intend to kill her too?

38:26.240 --> 38:27.640
Of course.

38:31.640 --> 38:32.840
I care deeply

38:33.440 --> 38:35.040
about settling scores.

38:37.360 --> 38:39.120
On the road of revenge,

38:41.920 --> 38:44.360
I cannot allow even one enemy
to meet a good end.

38:53.800 --> 38:54.880
And forget not,

38:56.960 --> 38:57.960
you're one of them too.

39:17.440 --> 39:18.280
Then

39:19.840 --> 39:22.000
why didn't you kill Yang Chuhao?

39:25.680 --> 39:26.960
He stood by and did nothing.

39:27.880 --> 39:29.000
That is not a capital crime.

39:29.840 --> 39:30.680
I still

39:31.760 --> 39:33.280
have my principles.

39:35.880 --> 39:38.120
Back then, he stood by and did nothing.

39:38.920 --> 39:41.080
Last night, he chose to help you.

39:42.880 --> 39:44.720
I have my principles too.

39:47.200 --> 39:50.240
He will know no peaceful end.

39:53.720 --> 39:55.480
Too bad you won't find him.

40:00.640 --> 40:02.000
Speaking of which,

40:02.960 --> 40:06.120
there is a young man surnamed Su
working under Yang Chuhao.

40:07.440 --> 40:08.480
Do you remember him?

40:11.600 --> 40:13.040
We crossed paths once.

40:13.120 --> 40:15.720
I looked into him.
He is not a Huben member.

40:18.000 --> 40:19.480
Of all involved in Yang's affairs,

40:19.560 --> 40:21.040
Yang himself is the only Huben member.

40:21.120 --> 40:22.800
That boy truly is not.

40:29.120 --> 40:30.680
Anyone who can catch your eye

40:31.560 --> 40:33.560
must have some wits.

40:34.160 --> 40:36.200
To work for Yang Chuhao

40:36.280 --> 40:38.800
and even handle something
as important as the accounts,

40:38.880 --> 40:40.880
wits alone aren't enough.

40:40.960 --> 40:42.320
He must also have a story behind him.

40:44.600 --> 40:46.040
‎He's like you.
